.SH "TASHKEEL DIACRITIZE"
Diacritize one UTF\-8 text input or DOCX document, preserving its content and layout.

Supply INPUT or \-\-text. A single dash reads UTF\-8 text from stdin. Text goes to stdout by default, with no added newline. DOCX requires an explicit .docx output path. Existing files are replaced only with \-\-force.
.PP
\fBUsage:\fR tashkeel diacritize [OPTIONS] [<INPUT>]
.PP
\fBOptions:\fR
.PP
.TP
\fB\-\-text\fR \fI<TEXT>\fR
Direct text instead of INPUT; whitespace is kept exactly.
.TP
\fB\-\-model\fR \fI<MODEL>\fR
Required model choice; no automatic selection or fallback.
.TP
\fB\-o, \-\-output\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Destination or \- for stdout [default: stdout for text]. DOCX requires a .docx path.
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Replace an existing output file atomically, including INPUT if explicitly selected.
.TP
\fB\-q, \-\-quiet\fR
Hide progress and setup notices; errors still appear on stderr.
.TP
\fB\-\-model\-dir\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Use verified model files from this directory without downloading anything.
.TP
\fB\-\-cache\-dir\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Model cache root [default: tashkeel in the operating system's user cache directory].
.TP
\fB\-\-offline\fR
Require verified cached or local model files; never download.
.TP
\fB\-\-ort\-library\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
CPU ONNX Runtime shared library (.so, .dylib or .dll). Otherwise use ORT_DYLIB_PATH, the bundled library beside tashkeel, then the system search path.
.TP
\fB\-\-threads\fR \fI<N>\fR
Native inference threads; must be greater than zero.
.RS
\fIDefault: \fR1
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-chunk\-size\fR \fI<N>\fR
Maximum source Unicode characters per chunk; must be greater than zero.
.RS
\fIDefault: \fR500
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fR
Print help
\fBArguments:\fR
.PP
.TP
\fB<INPUT>\fR
One .txt or .docx file, or \- for UTF\-8 text from stdin.
\fBExit status:\fR
.PP
.TP
\fB0\fR
Success
.TP
\fB1\fR
Setup, filesystem, document or inference error
.TP
\fB2\fR
Invalid arguments
.TP
\fB130\fR
Interrupted with Ctrl\-C
\fBExamples:\fR
.PP
Diacritize direct text
.PP
.RS 4
tashkeel \-\-text 'السلام عليكم' \-\-model shakkelha
.RE
.PP
Read text from stdin with a cached model
.PP
.RS 4
tashkeel \- \-\-model catt \-\-offline
.RE
.PP
Preserve a Word document's formatting
.PP
.RS 4
tashkeel book.docx \-\-model shakkelha \-o book.diacritized.docx
.RE
